  "question": {
    "text": "A cylinder of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is kept on an inclined plane having an angle of inclination <math><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math>. Axis of the cylinder makes an angle<math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>with the line along the greatest slope. Assuming that cylinder rolls without slipping, the acceleration of the cylinder is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image7-b92f4eef-008f-4837-acdf-6ab42467491a.jpg\" style=\"height: 184px; width: 250px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
